(1) Public utility structures and offices, storage and operations;
(2) Public uses;
(3) Building material sales;
(4) Catering establishments;
(5) Laundry, dry-cleaning and carpet cleaning;
(6) Sheet metal, welding, metal working, machine shop or tool repair;
(7) Garage or shop for the repair and servicing of motor vehicles, heavy equipment or machine parts;
(8) Fitness center;
(9) Craft manufacturing;
